      "sourceText": "输出约20 Hz真实时间重复当前结果，点云匹配则约2 Hz真实时间尝试一次；20 Hz不表示每次都得到新定位。TF时间取最后收到的扫描时间加0.1秒，固定在源码中，不是本块参数；也没有“已成功匹配过”的输出保护，启动初值同样可被发布。这里只记录输出接口，仍不展开此前搁置的导航走停或TF时效故障排查。",
      "translatedText": "Output repeats the current result at approximately 20 Hz real time; point cloud matching attempts once at approximately 2 Hz real time; 20 Hz does not mean a new localization is obtained every time\\. The TF time takes the last received scan time plus 0\\.1 seconds, fixed in the source code, not a parameter of this block; there is also no output protection for \"has already been successfully matched,\" and the startup initial value can likewise be published\\. Here only the output interface is recorded; the previously shelved troubleshooting of navigation start\\-stop or TF timeliness faults is still not expanded\\.",
